Xenia
-----

The export catalogue in `crates/xenolith-xex/src/exports.rs` is transcribed
from the export tables of the Xenia project: the name behind each ordinal a
title imports by. No executable code is taken from that project. The table
itself is transcribed, which is why its licence travels here.

