XenonRecomp
-----------

The meaning of the Direct3D vertex unpack type field, in
`crates/xenolith-lift/src/emit.rs`, was read from the XenonRecomp project
rather than derived here. It is a reading of an encoding rather than code taken
across, so no copy of that project is included. The attribution and its licence
are recorded because the reading is theirs.

